Today I discovered a new 'feature' (arg!) of the altars.
Being somewhat of a novice at Nethack (3.0PL6, btw), when
I found an altar I was overcome with joy.  I immediately
went forth to kill things for offering.  After converting
the altar from neutral to chaotic (love my barbarian),
I continued sacrificing corpses in the hopes of a
cloverleaf or, possibly, Stormbringer.  
I killed a werejackal, sacrificed it, and suddenly,
blood everywhere, poof, and its Jubilex the wonder
demon come to do evil things to me.  He demanded 85
zorkmids.  I was reeling.  Rather than risk being
killed, I gave him the 85 zorkmids.  He laughed about
cowardly humans and left, which was wonderful.  But 
he took my altar!!! UGH!  
Does anybody want to clue me in as to what happens
if I give him less (40 zorkmids), or if I stiff 
